<title>USA: Barnes &amp; Noble buys back Chapters stock.</title>
<headline>Barnes &amp; Noble buys back Chapters stock.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barnes &amp; Noble Inc said on Tuesday that it had brought back up to 20 percent its ownership in Chapters Inc.</p>
<p>The move followed an April 21 announcement by Chapters that Barnes &amp; Noble intended to exercise a maintenance right and return its ownership stake to its pre-IPO level of 20 percent.</p>
</text>
